{
  "description": "The opt-in diagnostics hook (policy.md, Diagnostics). A case with client.diagnostics true installs a hook; expect.diagnostics lists every event it received, compared exactly in the shared JSON form. A request body is compared parsed; an expected string may use the $repeat form.",
  "defaults": {
    "options": {
      "provider": "exa"
    }
  },
  "cases": [
